        "detailed_description": "Let the show begin!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a far of land called Terra…<br />\r\nTensions are beginning to rise…<br />\r\nPeople, everywhere, are dictated by their beliefs and religion, killing pushing away anyone who disagrees with them…<br />\r\nThe biggest of them being the Maluum, an evil cult hell-bent on making everyone share their beliefs.<br />\r\nAnyone who resists them faces the same fate: death. Those who oppose them are known as obstainers, people who resist the evil religion.<br />\r\nBut for our hero Yi Ping…<br />\r\nIt was just another quiet day with his friend Hera…<br />\r\nIn a little town called Kelna.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYi Ping is a teenage boy whose life is forever changed when his small town is attacked by an evil cult known as the Maluum. Who is this strange cult? What mysteries are they hiding? And is Yi Ping more closely connected to them than he thinks?<br />\r\nJoin Yi Ping and his friends on an epic quest to free Terra from the Maluum’s evil grip and experience a heart-touching story about a young boy conquering his anxiety and depression.<br />\r\nTales Of Grimace is a mature, traditional RPG where you: <br />\r\n• Explore the vast region of Terra and its amazing landscapes; <br />\r\n• Meet a cast of interesting characters that are relevant to the story; <br />\r\n• Discover the mysteries behind a main character tormented by his past.",
